格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"🌐 Multi-provider web search plugin for DeepSeek Harness: Zero-key Bing/Baidu direct search, free-tier APIs (Tavily/Brave/Serper/Bocha), SearXNG token auth, auto-fallback, and a built-in Web Settings GUI.","id":"gh:1334834472","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-web-search-multi","slug":"cinob/dsh-web-search-multi","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-external","dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"🌐 Multi-provider web search plugin for DeepSeek Harness: Zero-key Bing/Baidu direct search, free-tie"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"r APIs (Tavily/Brave/Serper/Bocha), SearXNG token auth, auto-fallback, and a built-in Web Settings G"},{"id":"p1s3","text":"PIs (Tavily/Brave/Serper/Bocha), SearXNG token auth, auto-fallback, and a built-in Web Settings GUI."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-web-search-multi"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"> Multi-provider web search plugin for **DeepSeek Harness (DSH)** supporting free-tier providers (36"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"0, Bing, Baidu, Tavily, Brave, Serper, Bocha, SearXNG, DuckDuckGo) with auto-fallback and Web Settin"},{"id":"p3s3","text":"g, Baidu, Tavily, Brave, Serper, Bocha, SearXNG, DuckDuckGo) with auto-fallback and Web Settings UI."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"English | 简体中文"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## 1. Overview"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"`dsh-web-search-multi` connects DeepSeek Harness to multiple search engines with automated fault tol"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"erance:\n- **Free Zero-Key Direct Engines**: 360 Search (real-time news and trending events), Bing, a"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"nd Baidu direct search without any API keys.\n- **AI-Native Free Tiers**: Tavily (1,000/mo), Brave Se"},{"id":"p6s4","text":"arch (2,000/mo), Serper/Google (2,500 free), Bocha AI.\n- **Private & Self-Hosted**: SearXNG with tok"},{"id":"p6s5","text":"en authentication.\n- **Global Fallback**: DuckDuckGo.\n- **Web GUI Control**: Full graphical settings"},{"id":"p6s6","text":" tab inside DSH Web UI (`Settings` -> `多源 Web 搜索`) with live connection testing and instant persiste"},{"id":"p6s7","text":"nce.\n- **Secure Credential Storage**: Secrets saved securely to `~/.dsh/.credentials.yaml` (mode 060"},{"id":"p6s8","text":"0), non-secret settings saved to `~/.dsh/settings.yaml`."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## 2. Compatibility"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"- **Node.js**: `>= 20.0.0`\n- **DeepSeek Harness**: Verified on mainline `v0.1.0+`\n- **Platform**: Li"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"nux / macOS / Windows"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## 3. Install"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"As a standard DSH Profile Bundle, installation is one simple command:"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"> **Note**: As a Profile Bundle, the plugin's built-in `cordis.patch.yml` automatically mounts and a"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"ctivates `multi-search`. There is **no need** to manually insert `web-search-multi` in `profiles/web"},{"id":"p12s3","text":"rch`. There is **no need** to manually insert `web-search-multi` in `profiles/web/cordis.patch.yml`."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"### Uninstallation"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"## 4. Quick Start"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"1. Start DSH Web:"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"2. Open Web GUI (`http://127.0.0.1:3080`) -> Click **Settings** (Gear icon) -> Select **多源 Web 搜索** "},{"id":"p18s2","text":"in the sidebar.\n3. Choose your preferred search engine or leave it on **自动策略 (Auto)**.\n4. (Optional)"},{"id":"p18s3","text":" Enter your API keys for Tavily, Brave, Serper, Bocha, or SearXNG Token, click Save, and test in rea"},{"id":"p18s4","text":"your API keys for Tavily, Brave, Serper, Bocha, or SearXNG Token, click Save, and test in real time."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## 5. Configuration"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"### Credentials & Environment Mapping\n| Key / Variable | Description |"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"| `TAVILY_API_KEY` | Tavily API Key (1,000 searches/mo) |\n| `BRAVE_API_KEY` | Brave Search API Key ("},{"id":"p21s2","text":"2,000 searches/mo) |\n| `SERPER_API_KEY` | Serper Google API Key (2,500 searches) |\n| `BOCHA_API_KEY`"},{"id":"p21s3","text":" | Bocha AI Search API Key |\n| `SEARXNG_URL` | SearXNG instance URL (e.g. `https://s.655443.xyz`) |\n"},{"id":"p21s4","text":"| `SEARXNG_TOKEN` | SearXNG access token (optional) |"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## 6. Permissions & Data Disclosures"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"- **Risk Level**: `low`\n- **Network**: Outbound HTTPS requests to selected search providers.\n- **Cre"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"dentials**: Secrets persist securely in `~/.dsh/.credentials.yaml` via `ctx.credentials`, general se"},{"id":"p23s3","text":"ttings in `~/.dsh/settings.yaml`."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"## 7. Development"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"## 8. License"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"MIT License.\n- Repository: https://github.com/cinob/dsh-web-search-multi"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
